'''The Mist''' is a location in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} located under [[Divan's Gateway]]. It houses [[Ghost]]s. 

== Location ==
'''The Mist''' is made out of white stained glass, white wool, and ice. The Mist is filled with [[Ghost]]s, enemies that can be damaged, although their health is not displayed and is therefore difficult to find. They look like invisible charged creepers. They have {{HP|1M}} Health and deal high damage. It isn't recommended to go into The Mist in early game.

When the player enters the The Mist, the following message is displayed on their screen:<br>

　　　　　　　　　　{{mctxt|size=30|c|bold=true|DANGER}}<br>
　　　{{mctxt|size=16|8|Powerful creatures reside in The Mist}}

{{ZoneText|Pain, only pain.}}

